# Material form demand queue

Safety valve unchanged: no stand-in ingredients. A recipe or obtain card that
hits a missing part still stays `blocked`.

Queue: do not wait until the next recipe card to register known GT6-generated
demanded `(material, prefix)` pairs. Do not use `blocked.md` / `current_gap`
as that work order.

1. Prep census (does not occupy unique-active):
   `tools/waves/prep/material-form-demand-census/census.json`
2. Later unique-active opens only `openable`. `gated_unresolved` is already in
   the gate; fix `gt6_resolve.form_exists` / obtain overlays, do not re-gate.
3. `ungated_generated_flag_pairs` is scale, not a to-do.

Forbidden: invent forms GT6 would not generate; unbounded long-tail import;
opening forms on a recipe/identity card "while we are here".
